flowchart TD
    U[User goal and constraints] --> S[Versioned specification and acceptance criteria]
    S --> P[Planner proposes typed graph]
    P --> C[Deterministic compiler and policy checks]
    C --> R{Choose validated execution route}
    R --> A[One capable agent]
    R --> W[Scoped parallel workers]
    A --> I[Integrate immutable artifacts]
    W --> I
    I --> V[Independent verification on exact candidate]
    V --> G{Current mandatory evidence complete?}
    G -->|Yes| D[Deliver or perform authorized release]
    G -->|No| F{Failure class and remaining budget}
    F -->|Repairable| P
    F -->|Ambiguous effect| X[Reconcile authoritative remote state]
    F -->|Blocked or exhausted| B[Actionable incomplete report]
    X --> C
    L[(Durable task, artifact, evidence and effect ledger)] -.-> C
    L -.-> I
    V -.-> L
    D --> O[Observe outcomes and propose evaluated improvements]
